{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you trust the cards? You shouldn't. In <strong>Definitely Not Addictive</strong>, you'll scheme, shuffle, and struggle through a darkly comedic world. Manipulate your luck with powerful items, craft devious strategies, and face off against colorful characters who don't always have your best interests at heart.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299350/extras/913179df1de813041f3d2b875c678206.avif?t=1756835990\" width=144 height=255 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Jack Misery - your enemy (or best friend?)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Jack Misery's twisted deals, dodge The Travelling Salesman's insults, and decode The Old Woman's cryptic guidance\u2014your salvation or undoing hangs in the balance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game about drawing cards. It\u2019s about the decisions you make, the consequences you face, and the lengths you\u2019ll go to for one more chance at winning Jack in one of his mini-games.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What You Can Do</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge powerful deck combinations in this grim satirical roguelike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit cigarettes, charms, and drinks to bend luck in your favor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel a twisted narrative where your choices echo through each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master an atmosphere that evolves with your growing addiction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299350/extras/c6ade275ab0607eb0efa5304f128da2d.poster.avif?t=1756835990\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shar